DTEND:20261122T235900Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 GMT: GovAI Summer Fellowship 2027 (AI governance\, L
 ondon or Washington DC\, GBP 14\,000 for 3 months)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 22 Nov 2026 at 23:59 GMT.\n\nGovAI's Summer Fellowship b
 rings early-career researchers and practitioners into AI governance for th
 ree months of full-time work on a research or applied project under the me
 ntorship of a GovAI researcher. TRACKS: UK Research Track and UK Applied T
 rack in London\, plus a Washington DC track\, each with its own applicatio
 n page.\n\nOrganisation: Centre for the Governance of AI (GovAI)\nLocation
 : London\, UK or Washington\, DC\, USA\; in person\, full time. Open world
 wide\; temporary work visa sponsorship available.\nAward: GBP 14\,000 for 
 3 months plus travel support (UK Research Track figure\; DC track has its 
 own stipend). No application fee.\nDuration: 7 June to 27 August 2027\, fu
 ll time\n\nMore: https://www.governance.ai/opportunities?utm_source=artifi
 cialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.governance.ai/opportunities?utm_source=artificialnouveaugra
 ntdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:London\, UK or Washington\, DC\, USA\; in person\, full time. Open
  worldwide\; temporary work visa sponsorship available.
END:VEVENT
