 ch a creative practitioner works as a peer alongside a university host\, o
 pening new approaches and conversations while developing their own practic
 e.\n\nOrganisation: University of Exeter Arts and Culture\nLocation: Exete
 r\, UK (Exeter campus). No nationality or residence restriction stated.\nA
 ward: GBP 6\,000 per fellowship (incl. VAT\, freelance basis)\, covering t
 he practitioner's fee\, travel and accommodation\, production costs and do
 cumentation. No application fee.\nDuration: 4 to 5 week exploratory placem
 ent during the 2026/27 academic year (ending July 2027).\n\nMore: https://
 www.artsandcultureexeter.co.uk/news/callout-for-artists-creative-fellowshi
