SUMMARY:Deadline: Net+ Centre for Health and Climate Solutions: Creative Fe
 llowships 2027 (incl. AI and environmental intelligence topic)
DESCRIPTION:The Net+ Centre for Health and Climate Solutions offers three C
 reative Fellowships in 2027: hosted\, exploratory placements that bring a 
 creative practitioner of any artform (visual\, digital\, sound\, performin
 g arts\, craft\, design\, film\, literature\, music) into a research or po
 licy setting.\n\nOrganisation: Net+ Centre for Health and Climate Solution
 s (University of Exeter)\, with the Centre for Environmental Intelligence\
 , the National Trust and Natural England\nLocation: UK\; host-based placem
 ents (University of Exeter Centre for Environmental Intelligence\, Nationa
 l Trust\, Natural England). Interviews online. No nationality or residence
  restriction stated.\nAward: GBP 6\,000 per fellowship (incl. VAT)\, cover
 ing a 5-week practitioner fee\, equipment\, travel\, accommodation and pro
 duction\, plus GBP 1\,000 for dissemination and engagement. Interviewees r
 eceive GBP 100. No application fee.\nDuration: 5 weeks (in one block or sp
 read over several months)\, completed between January and October 2027.\n\
 nMore: https://netpositivecentre.com/collaborate/net-creative-fellowships-
 2027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://netpositivecentre.com/collaborate/net-creative-fellowships-2027
 /?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:UK\; host-based placements (University of Exeter Centre for Enviro
 nmental Intelligence\, National Trust\, Natural England). Interviews onlin
 e. No nationality or residence restriction stated.
